// Karoryfer Lecolds libraries gretsch: hollowbody electric guitar (green Gretsch Anniversary), plucked. Samples: Karoryfer Lecolds (Black And Green Guitars, Emily Guitar, Black And Blue Basses, D. Smolken double bass, Aliexpress Erhu, Swirly Drums), CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sfzinstruments).
